{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18056","headline":"嘲鲁连子 · 韩愈","name":"嘲鲁连子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲁连细而黠，有似黄鹞子。\n田巴兀老苍，怜汝矜爪觜。\n开端要惊人，雄跨吾厌矣。\n高拱禅鸿声，若辍一杯水。\n独称唐虞贤，顾未知之耳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}